  "description": "The Mamashin, known for bringing plagues, was actually a protector of humans! Though feared and hated by people for supposedly spreading disease, this god secretly served as a guardian spirit, protecting human souls from evil spirits who coveted them. Cheolhyeon, who has just become a newly Mamashin, receives his first mission: to investigate a village where people have mysteriously disappeared. During his investigation, he encounters a powerful new evil spirit called “Steel Demon” that dares to challenge even the gods, putting him in grave danger... \n\nCan Cheolhyeon successfully complete his first mission?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11014914), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/505082772), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000063181), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/mamasin), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240521), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64275169)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/180765)",
